{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01V4kGXLkEbkG3HkeHWbfytJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F228VqZD8LdbTdriTvzz8C","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ns = open('TODO.md').read()\ns = s.replace('- [ ] **sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex**', '- [x] **sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex**')\nopen('TODO.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> KEY_DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n\n- **sos_257:** restricted mana lives in a separate `_restricted_pool` on\n  `ManaPool`; `can_pay`/`pay` gained an optional `spell=` param (passed by\n  `cast_spell`) and merge restricted mana only for instant/sorcery spells,\n  spending restricted first. Single restriction kind — deliberate limitation.\n- **sos_257:** animation mutates in place; `_reset_characteristics` override\n  re-asserts the permanent animation across effect cycles. The +1/+0 pump is a\n  direct `modified_power` bump that cleanup's characteristic reset undoes.\n- **sos_257:** `_sba_creature_zero_toughness` gained a creature-type gate (rule\n  704.5f applies to creatures) so the un-animated land's toughness property (0)\n  doesn't get it binned.\nEOF\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_257: Great Hall of the Biblioplex\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Mark TODO, log decisions, commit sos_257"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":925,"cache_read_input_tokens":200048,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":925},"output_tokens":61,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e89db2fe-0d6e-4510-b5e6-a7586e7fc62b","uuid":"316e4f13-ae12-411b-ab27-3841074f6fd2","request_id":"req_011CbwAixZpQyXy2Gtexkt5J"}
